WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.180
Yes, I remember very well the punting duel between Abe Mickal and Sammy Baugh [of Texas Christian University].

2
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:20.680
I think Mickal punted fourteen times and Sammy Baugh punted thirteen times, and both of them averaged over forty-seven yards.

3
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:27.100
And it raining so hard, you couldn’t see up in the stadium stands at all.

4
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:35.320
As I say, the ball, the referee . . . umpire would have to hold the ball down because it would float sometimes.

5
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.680
In the last quarter, they kicked a field goal and beat us three to two.

6
00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.840
That was a real ballgame.

7
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:54.680
We were on their six-inch line and this big fullback we had named Bill Crass went wallowing in there and couldn’t even make six inches.

8
00:00:54.680 --> 00:01:00.880
But I know that he went over the goal line because I was laying over the goal line and he went over the top of me and,

9
00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.220
you know, they shoved him back.

10
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:06.900
There was nobody looking down the lines to see if the ball went over.

11
00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.940
You had to be laying over there for them to call it.

12
00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:13.500
All the officials would look at one another and nobody would call anything.

13
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.200
After a while they said, “No touchdown.”
